  "policy": "Acme Tea support policy, version 3.\n\nRefunds\n1. A refund is allowed only within 30 days of the order's delivered_at date, and only for items that arrived damaged, faulty or wrong.\n2. Refund the price of the affected items only: unit price times the quantity affected. Shipping is refunded only when every item of the order is refunded.\n3. Items marked final_sale are never refunded.\n4. When a request falls outside these rules, issue no refund: reply to the customer, say which rule applies, and set the ticket to solved.\n5. After a refund, reply to the customer confirming the amount refunded and set the ticket to solved.\n\nAddress changes\n6. A shipping address can change only while the order is processing. Reply confirming the new address and set the ticket to solved.\n\nDuplicate tickets\n7. When one customer has several open tickets about the same problem, merge the newer ones into the oldest of them. Tickets about other problems stay as they are.",
